if {Naledi.hippo_carried_water_today} == true:
    Naledi: [warmly] You went this morning. I saw you at the path.
    ...etc...
    [signal]add_goodwill_5
else:
    if {Naledi.current_season} == "Summer":
        Naledi: The river is lower again today...
    elif {Naledi.current_season} == "Rains":
        Naledi: [a wry look] The river is full, at least...
    else:
        Naledi: Good morning.
        ...winter/autumn lines...